OL,3,GNEWSAHotel no longer housing asylum
OL,4,Aseekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council confirmed on Tuesday that
OL,7,Feveryone had been moved out of the
OL,8,Fhotel. The Home Office has been
OL,9,Fapproached for comment.
